stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> New: router sends NewOrder (audit cause Sent)
  New --> Acknowledged: ER New
  New --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill, cum below ordered
  New --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  New --> Rejected: ER Rejected
  New --> CancelRequested: time limit, book move or deadline
  New --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled (IOC remainder)
  Acknowledged --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill
  Acknowledged --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  Acknowledged --> Rejected: ER Rejected
  Acknowledged --> CancelRequested: cancel sent
  Acknowledged --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled
  PartiallyFilled --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill
  PartiallyFilled --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  PartiallyFilled --> CancelRequested: cancel sent
  PartiallyFilled --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled
  CancelRequested --> CancelRequested: ER fill (raced the cancel)
  CancelRequested --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  CancelRequested --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled, plain cancel
  CancelRequested --> Replaced: ER Cancelled, quantity to be re-routed
  CancelRequested --> Acknowledged: cancel reject, nothing filled
  CancelRequested --> PartiallyFilled: cancel reject, some filled
  Cancelled --> Cancelled: late fill up to the venue's reported cum
  Replaced --> Replaced: late fill up to the venue's reported cum
  Filled --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]: leaves zero, slot released
  Replaced --> [*]: leaves zero, slot released
  Rejected --> [*]
